      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"28\" type=\"會\">28 勤授長者會</cb:mulu>\r\n<milestone n=\"97\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a23\">0543a23</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a24\">0543a24</span><cb:div type=\"hui\">\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a25\">0543a25</span><cb:juan n=\"097\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"097\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷第九十七</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a26\">0543a26</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a27\">0543a27</span><byline cb:type=\"Translator\"><anchor xml:id=\"fxT11p0543a01\"/>大唐三<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543003\">藏＋（法師）【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543003\">藏【大】，藏法師【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0543003\"><p class=\"lg\">藏</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">藏法師</rdg></app>菩提流志奉　<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543004\">詔＝誥【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543004\">詔【大】，誥【宮】</span><app n=\"0543004\"><p class=\"lg\">詔</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">誥</rdg></app>譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a28\">0543a28</span><cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"29\" type=\"會\">29 優陀延王會</cb:mulu><head>優陀延王會第二十九</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a29\">0543a29</span><p>如是我聞：</p><p>一時佛在拘睒彌國瞿師羅園，與\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b01\">0543b01</span>大比丘眾千二百五十人俱。</p><p>爾時優陀延王\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b02\">0543b02</span>第一夫人名曰舍摩，常於如來及諸聖眾深\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b03\">0543b03</span>信恭敬親近供養，及常稱讚如來功德。時王\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b04\">0543b04</span>復有第二夫人名為帝女，常懷諂妬，往彼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b05\">0543b05</span>王所，妄說如來并諸弟子於大夫人有所非\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b06\">0543b06</span>法。王聞是語極生瞋怒，即以箭射舍摩夫人。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b07\">0543b07</span>爾時夫人哀愍王故入慈三昧，時所放箭遂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b08\">0543b08</span>即却還至王頂上空中而住，其箭焰赫猶如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b09\">0543b09</span>火聚甚可怖畏。乃至三<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543005\">發＝射【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543005\">發【大】，射【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0543005\"><p class=\"lg\">發</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">射</rdg></app>，箭皆如是。</p><p>爾時\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b10\">0543b10</span>優陀延王既覩斯事舉身毛竪，驚忙悔恨謂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b11\">0543b11</span>夫人曰：「汝為天女、為龍女耶？為復夜叉、乾闥\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b12\">0543b12</span>婆女、毘舍遮女、羅剎女耶？」</p><p>夫人答言：「我非\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b13\">0543b13</span>天女，乃至亦非羅剎之女。大王當知，我於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b14\">0543b14</span>佛所聽聞正法，受持五戒作優婆夷，哀愍大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b15\">0543b15</span>王入慈三昧。王雖於我生不善心，由我慈願\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b16\">0543b16</span>得無傷損。」因<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543006\">歎＝勸【三】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543006\">歎【大】，勸【宋】【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0543006\"><p class=\"lg\">歎</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">勸</rdg></app>王言：「善哉大王！當於如來、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b17\">0543b17</span>應、正遍知歸命頂禮，必獲安隱。」</p><p>優陀延王便\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b18\">0543b18</span>作是念：「彼於佛所聽聞正法作優婆夷，尚有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b19\">0543b19</span>如此威神之力，何況如來、應、正等覺。」作是念\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b20\">0543b20</span>已，即往佛所頂禮佛足，右遶三匝，白言：「世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b21\">0543b21</span>尊！我由欲染因緣，為彼女人虛妄言說之所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b22\">0543b22</span>誑惑，遂於如來及諸聖眾生毒害意。」具陳\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b23\">0543b23</span>上已。復白佛言：「唯願如來及諸聖眾，施我\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b24\">0543b24</span>歡喜、聽我懺悔，如斯罪<g ref=\"#CB00985\"/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543007\">令＝今【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543007\">令【大】，今【宮】</span><app n=\"0543007\"><p class=\"lg\">令</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">今</rdg></app>速消滅。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b25\">0543b25</span><p>爾時世尊告彼王言：「如汝所說，謂於如來及\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b26\">0543b26</span>諸聖眾如凡愚人有諸過患，遂於福田妄起\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b27\">0543b27</span>瞋毒。汝今若能依聖法律，自悔其罪、無覆藏\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b28\">0543b28</span>心、盡未來世不復更犯，我當攝受，令汝當來\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543b29\">0543b29</span>善法增長。」</p><p>優陀延王復白佛言：「世尊！我為\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c01\">0543c01</span>女人之所迷倒、狂亂無知，因此發生麁猛瞋\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c02\">0543c02</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543008\">毒＝恚【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543008\">毒【大】，恚【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0543008\"><p class=\"lg\">毒</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">恚</rdg></app>，由斯罪業當墮地獄。唯願世尊利益安\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c03\">0543c03</span>樂諸眾生故，慈悲開示女人諂曲虛誑過患，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c04\">0543c04</span>勿令我等親近女人，當於長夜得免諸苦。」</p><p>佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c05\">0543c05</span>言：「且置斯事。何要問此不問餘耶？」</p><p>王言：「世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c06\">0543c06</span>尊！我無異問。女人令我造地獄業，我於今\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c07\">0543c07</span>者唯為了知女人過患、女人諂曲虛誑邪媚。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c08\">0543c08</span>願為開示。」乃至三請亦如是說。</p><p>佛言：「王應\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c09\">0543c09</span>先知丈夫過患，然後觀察女人過<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543009\">失＝患【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543009\">失【大】，患【明】</span><app n=\"0543009\"><p class=\"lg\">失</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">患</rdg></app>。」</p><p>優陀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c10\">0543c10</span>延王：「唯然世尊。願樂欲聞。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c11\">0543c11</span><p>佛言：「一切丈夫皆由四種不善<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543010\">愆＝<g ref=\"#CB00985\"/>【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543010\">愆【大】，<g ref=\"#CB00985\"/>【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0543010\"><p class=\"lg\">愆</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\"><g ref=\"#CB00985\"/></rdg></app>過，為諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c12\">0543c12</span>女人之所迷亂。何者為四？一者於諸欲染耽\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c13\">0543c13</span>著無厭，樂觀女人而自縱逸，不知親近沙門\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c14\">0543c14</span>及婆羅門具清淨戒修福業者。以不親近如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c15\">0543c15</span>是等人，則於淨信及淨尸羅多聞施慧悉皆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c16\">0543c16</span>退失。彼由無有信戒多聞施慧等法，非善丈\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c17\">0543c17</span>夫，行餓鬼法、無有智慧、耽欲放逸，欲之所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c18\">0543c18</span>執、欲所繫縛、欲所活命，親近愚夫、遠諸智\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c19\">0543c19</span>者、惡友為伴、行非所宜，貪著女人不淨境\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c20\">0543c20</span>界，便為女人之所調伏。猶如奴僕，繫屬墮\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c21\">0543c21</span>落諸女人所。無慚無愧親近遊止諸瘡漏門，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c22\">0543c22</span>膿血穢污<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543011\">洟＝涕【三】【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543011\">洟【大】＊，涕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0543011\"><p class=\"lg\">洟</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">涕</rdg></app>唾常流，猶如塚間不淨境界。至\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c23\">0543c23</span>於父母違背恩養，捨離沙門及婆羅門，不生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c24\">0543c24</span>殷重恭敬供養。習行畜生所行之法，於佛法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c25\">0543c25</span>僧不生淨信，於涅槃界永當退失。如是等人，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c26\">0543c26</span>當入眾合乃至阿鼻諸大地獄，亦復當墮鬼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c27\">0543c27</span>界畜生無有救護。雖聞我教，猶數思念邪\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c28\">0543c28</span>惡女人歌舞戲笑不生厭離。當知彼習愚人\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543c29\">0543c29</span>之法，不樂修行善丈夫事。大王！當知丈夫\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a01\">0544a01</span>親近女人之時，即是親近惡道之法。此是丈\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a02\">0544a02</span>夫第一過患。」</p><p>爾時世尊而說偈言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a03\">0544a03</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「諸欲皆苦，<caesura/>下劣穢惡，<caesura/>膿血不淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a04\">0544a04</span><p class=\"lg\">深可厭畏。<caesura/>眾多過患，<caesura/>之所集處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a05\">0544a05</span><p class=\"lg\">何有智人，<caesura/>於此忻樂？<caesura/>猶如廁中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a06\">0544a06</span><p class=\"lg\">不淨盈溢，<caesura/>亦如死狗，<caesura/>若死野干，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a07\">0544a07</span><p class=\"lg\">及屍陀林，<caesura/>穢污充遍；<caesura/>欲染之患，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a08\">0544a08</span><p class=\"lg\">可厭亦然。<caesura/>諸愚癡輩，<caesura/>愛戀女人，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a09\">0544a09</span><p class=\"lg\">如犬生子，<caesura/>未甞捨離；<caesura/>亦如蠅見，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a10\">0544a10</span><p class=\"lg\">所吐飲食；<caesura/>又若群猪，<caesura/>貪求糞穢。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a11\">0544a11</span><p class=\"lg\">女人能壞，<caesura/>清淨禁戒，<caesura/>亦復退失，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a12\">0544a12</span><p class=\"lg\">功德名聞，<caesura/>為地獄因，<caesura/>障生天道；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a13\">0544a13</span><p class=\"lg\">何有智人，<caesura/>於此忻樂？<caesura/>又如有人，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a14\">0544a14</span><p class=\"lg\">服食毒藥，<caesura/>身心痛惱，<caesura/>不能運動。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a15\">0544a15</span><p class=\"lg\">由是欲因，<caesura/>能為苦本，<caesura/>如身有毒，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a16\">0544a16</span><p class=\"lg\">愚不了知。<caesura/>亦如不了，<caesura/>幻化之法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a17\">0544a17</span><p class=\"lg\">妄有尋求，<caesura/>但自疲苦。<caesura/>愚夫亦爾，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a18\">0544a18</span><p class=\"lg\">常於欲染，<caesura/>疲苦貪求，<caesura/>墮諸地獄。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a19\">0544a19</span><p class=\"lg\">或設飲食，<caesura/>歌舞<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0544001\">伎＝妓【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0544001\">伎【大】，妓【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0544001\"><p class=\"lg\">伎</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">妓</rdg></app>樂，<caesura/>婚娶他女，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a20\">0544a20</span><p class=\"lg\">將為己妻，<caesura/>積集眾多，<caesura/>無利苦法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a21\">0544a21</span><p class=\"lg\">愚夫造此，<caesura/>無利之業，<caesura/>增長諸罪，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a22\">0544a22</span><p class=\"lg\">退失善根。<caesura/>於無利中，<caesura/>不惜身命，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a23\">0544a23</span><p class=\"lg\">由斯墜墮，<caesura/>惡道深坑，<caesura/>便招地獄，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a24\">0544a24</span><p class=\"lg\">猛焰鐵丸，<caesura/>鋒刃刀山，<caesura/>毒箭諸苦。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a25\">0544a25</span><p class=\"lg\">女人能集，<caesura/>眾多苦事，<caesura/>假以花香，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a26\">0544a26</span><p class=\"lg\">而為嚴好。<caesura/>愚人於此，<caesura/>妄起貪求，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a27\">0544a27</span><p class=\"lg\">親近稱譽，<caesura/>下劣之法，<caesura/>退失智慧，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a28\">0544a28</span><p class=\"lg\">墮落三塗。<caesura/>此由愚癡，<caesura/>之所迷惑，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544a29\">0544a29</span><p class=\"lg\">如海疲鳥，<caesura/>迷於彼岸；<caesura/>又如愚夫，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b01\">0544b01</span><p class=\"lg\">取於熱鐵，<caesura/>置之頸項，<caesura/>如牛被軛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b02\">0544b02</span><p class=\"lg\">欲如諸酒，<caesura/>狂亂於人，<caesura/>如何愚夫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b03\">0544b03</span><p class=\"lg\">不知苦本？<caesura/>或於父母，<caesura/>不識恩慈，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b04\">0544b04</span><p class=\"lg\">皆由欲染，<caesura/>生此過患。<caesura/>常於如是，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b05\">0544b05</span><p class=\"lg\">邪欲之法，<caesura/>稱讚習行，<caesura/>無有慚愧。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b06\">0544b06</span><p class=\"lg\">彼由愚癡，<caesura/>所迷亂故，<caesura/>作是罪已，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b07\">0544b07</span><p class=\"lg\">當趣三塗。<caesura/>耽重於欲，<caesura/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0544002\">惛＝昏【三】【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0544002\">惛【大】＊，昏【宋】【元】【明】【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0544002\"><p class=\"lg\">惛</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">昏</rdg></app>醉之人，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b08\">0544b08</span><p class=\"lg\">父母之恩，<caesura/>亦能棄捨。<caesura/>若有貪染，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b09\">0544b09</span><p class=\"lg\">親近欲者，<caesura/>則為違背，<caesura/>福德上田。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b10\">0544b10</span><p class=\"lg\">無量俱胝，<caesura/>妄想煩擾，<caesura/>展轉逼惱，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b11\">0544b11</span><p class=\"lg\">從此而生。<caesura/>或復悕求，<caesura/>世間財位，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b12\">0544b12</span><p class=\"lg\">以是非法，<caesura/>展轉相勸。<caesura/>由此現招，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b13\">0544b13</span><p class=\"lg\">捶打苦事，<caesura/>死必當墮，<caesura/>阿鼻地獄。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b14\">0544b14</span><p class=\"lg\">現見眾苦，<caesura/>皆來集身，<caesura/>善友乖離，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b15\">0544b15</span><p class=\"lg\">天宮永失。<caesura/>何有智人，<caesura/>於此忻樂？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b16\">0544b16</span><p class=\"lg\">寧投鐵獄，<caesura/>馳走刀山，<caesura/>眠臥焰爐，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b17\">0544b17</span><p class=\"lg\">不親女色。<caesura/>若常貪染，<caesura/>邪欲之者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b18\">0544b18</span><p class=\"lg\">退失眾多，<caesura/>諸利樂事。<caesura/>女人能作，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b19\">0544b19</span><p class=\"lg\">眾苦之因，<caesura/>欲能滅壞，<caesura/>一切安樂。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b20\">0544b20</span><p class=\"lg\">惡法積集，<caesura/>善友乖離，<caesura/>皆以耽求，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b21\">0544b21</span><p class=\"lg\">女人為本。<caesura/>若有得聞，<caesura/>我之所說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b22\">0544b22</span><p class=\"lg\">能於女人，<caesura/>深生厭離，<caesura/>則為莊嚴，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b23\">0544b23</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨天道，<caesura/>亦當速證，<caesura/>無上菩提。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b24\">0544b24</span><p>「復次大王！夫父母者皆願利樂所生子故，難\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b25\">0544b25</span>作能作、能忍一切難忍之事，假令種種不淨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b26\">0544b26</span>穢惡皆能忍之。又欲令子色力之身速增長\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b27\">0544b27</span>故，令見閻浮勝妙之事，乳<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0544003\">餔＝哺【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0544003\">餔【大】，哺【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0544003\"><p class=\"lg\">餔</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">哺</rdg></app>養育無疲厭\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b28\">0544b28</span>心。或為令子獲諸妙樂，艱辛經求所得財物，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544b29\">0544b29</span>供給營<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0544004\">辦＝辨【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0544004\">辦【大】，辨【宮】</span><app n=\"0544004\"><p class=\"lg\">辦</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">辨</rdg></app>資生所須，及往他家結求婚娶。既\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c01\">0544c01</span>婚娶已，於他女人愛戀耽著，由耽著故<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0544002\"><p class=\"lg\">惛</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">昏</rdg></app>醉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c02\">0544c02</span>纏心，或見父母漸將衰老違逆輕欺，所有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c03\">0544c03</span>資財無慚費用，或令父母不住於家。如是皆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c04\">0544c04</span>由欲所迷倒。大王！當知以此因緣，於己父母\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c05\">0544c05</span>棄背恩養，於他女人尊重承事，種種供給無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c06\">0544c06</span>疲厭心，即是成就地獄之本。此是丈夫第二\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c07\">0544c07</span>過患。」</p><p>爾時世尊而說偈言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c08\">0544c08</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「汝等當知，<caesura/>尊重供養，<caesura/>於父母者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c09\">0544c09</span><p class=\"lg\">是人常有，<caesura/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0544005\">釋梵＝梵釋【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0544005\">釋梵【大】，梵釋【宮】</span><app n=\"0544005\"><p class=\"lg\">釋梵</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">梵釋</rdg></app>護世，<caesura/>之所扶持，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c10\">0544c10</span><p class=\"lg\">能令居家，<caesura/>安隱快樂。<caesura/>或因貿易，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c11\">0544c11</span><p class=\"lg\">大海遠方，<caesura/>安隱往來，<caesura/>獲諸財利。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c12\">0544c12</span><p class=\"lg\">此即說為，<caesura/>無價大寶，<caesura/>現能與果，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c13\">0544c13</span><p class=\"lg\">名最上田，<caesura/>如是現世，<caesura/>果報珍寶，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c14\">0544c14</span><p class=\"lg\">皆因供養，<caesura/>父母而得。<caesura/>復於來世，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c15\">0544c15</span><p class=\"lg\">當得遠離，<caesura/>駝驢等身，<caesura/>負重驅役。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c16\">0544c16</span><p class=\"lg\">亦復不受，<caesura/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0544006\">屍＝屎【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0544006\">屍【大】，屎【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0544006\"><p class=\"lg\">屍</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">屎</rdg></app>糞灰河，<caesura/>刀山鋒刃，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c17\">0544c17</span><p class=\"lg\">鎔銅等苦。<caesura/>又於來世，<caesura/>生在人中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c18\">0544c18</span><p class=\"lg\">富有財寶，<caesura/>豐饒穀帛，<caesura/>妻子眷屬，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c19\">0544c19</span><p class=\"lg\">悉皆和穆。<caesura/>或復當來，<caesura/>得生天上，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c20\">0544c20</span><p class=\"lg\">宮殿園苑，<caesura/>音樂自然，<caesura/>縱意歡娛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c21\">0544c21</span><p class=\"lg\">受諸妙樂。<caesura/>何有智者，<caesura/>聞是法音，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c22\">0544c22</span><p class=\"lg\">於父母田，<caesura/>不勤供養？</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c23\">0544c23</span><p>「復次大王！若諸丈夫由於邪見，不知自身速\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c24\">0544c24</span>當壞滅，造作諸惡而自欺誑。彼愚癡人虛度\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c25\">0544c25</span>長夜，猶如木石彫刻所成，雖形似人而無所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c26\">0544c26</span>識。習諸欲者，即是成就往惡趣業。此是丈\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c27\">0544c27</span>夫第三過患。」</p><p>爾時世尊而說偈言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c28\">0544c28</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「丈夫為欲，<caesura/>之所迷亂，<caesura/>由斯造作，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0544c29\">0544c29</span><p class=\"lg\">種種諸罪。<caesura/>倒見闇障，<caesura/>隱蔽其心，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a01\">0545a01</span><p class=\"lg\">乘此當生，<caesura/>惡趣牢獄。<caesura/>邪行之者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a02\">0545a02</span><p class=\"lg\">當復遠離，<caesura/>一切賢聖，<caesura/>亦不恭敬，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a03\">0545a03</span><p class=\"lg\">諸沙門等。<caesura/>由顛倒見，<caesura/>乃至歸命，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a04\">0545a04</span><p class=\"lg\">山河邪魅，<caesura/>為於貪欲，<caesura/>或復殺害，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a05\">0545a05</span><p class=\"lg\">一切禽獸，<caesura/>祭祀神祇。<caesura/>倒見為因，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a06\">0545a06</span><p class=\"lg\">非法求福，<caesura/>由斯永離，<caesura/>一切安樂。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a07\">0545a07</span><p class=\"lg\">若於是中，<caesura/>造惡之者，<caesura/>不知淨信，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a08\">0545a08</span><p class=\"lg\">兇險無慚。<caesura/>如是之人，<caesura/>永離賢聖，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a09\">0545a09</span><p class=\"lg\">彼必當墮，<caesura/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545001\"><g ref=\"#CB00079\"/>＝嘷【元】【明】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545001\"><g ref=\"#CB00079\"/>【大】＊，嘷【元】【明】＊</span><app n=\"0545001\"><p class=\"lg\"><g ref=\"#CB00079\"/></lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">嘷</rdg></app>叫地獄。<caesura/>或為於欲，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a10\">0545a10</span><p class=\"lg\">逼惱於他，<caesura/>當墮燒然，<caesura/>極燒然獄。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a11\">0545a11</span><p class=\"lg\">復由倒見，<caesura/>於佛法僧，<caesura/>不能親近，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a12\">0545a12</span><p class=\"lg\">恭敬供養，<caesura/>正教法寶，<caesura/>而不聽聞，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a13\">0545a13</span><p class=\"lg\">遠離賢聖，<caesura/>墮諸惡趣。<caesura/>是故智者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a14\">0545a14</span><p class=\"lg\">既得人身，<caesura/>勿復作斯，<caesura/>顛倒妄見；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a15\">0545a15</span><p class=\"lg\">勤修布施，<caesura/>及淨尸羅，<caesura/>當得生天，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a16\">0545a16</span><p class=\"lg\">證菩提道。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a17\">0545a17</span><p>「復次大王！或有丈夫為於身命，極自勞苦積\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a18\">0545a18</span>集珍財。後為女人所纏攝故，如彼僮僕敬事\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a19\">0545a19</span>供承，由是因緣慳惜財寶，不施沙門及婆羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a20\">0545a20</span>門，亦復堪忍王法治罰，輕毀<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545002\">凌＝陵【三】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545002\">凌【大】，陵【宋】【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0545002\"><p class=\"lg\">凌</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">陵</rdg></app>辱悉能受之。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a21\">0545a21</span>或被女人捶打呵叱，或至怖懼屈意瞻奉。見\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a22\">0545a22</span>其憂<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545003\">戚＝慼【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545003\">戚【大】，慼【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0545003\"><p class=\"lg\">戚</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">慼</rdg></app>即自念言：『我今云何令彼歡悅？』當觀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a23\">0545a23</span>此人是欲僮僕，於斯不淨下劣之境，而生淨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a24\">0545a24</span>想起於愛染。親近如是女人之時，即是圓滿\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a25\">0545a25</span>惡趣之業。此是丈夫第四過患。」</p><p>爾時世尊而\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a26\">0545a26</span>說偈<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545004\">言＝曰【宋】【元】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545004\">言【大】，曰【宋】【元】【宮】</span><app n=\"0545004\"><p class=\"lg\">言</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【宮】\">曰</rdg></app>：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a27\">0545a27</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「耽欲<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0544002\"><p class=\"lg\">惛</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">昏</rdg></app>醉人，<caesura/>彼實無安樂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a28\">0545a28</span><p class=\"lg\">親近惡法故，<caesura/>不名善丈夫。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545a29\">0545a29</span><p class=\"lg\">若人自縱逸，<caesura/>無有禁戒者，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b01\">0545b01</span><p class=\"lg\">隨心之所為，<caesura/>失壞於福利。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b02\">0545b02</span><p class=\"lg\">彼無智慧人，<caesura/>行於畜生法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b03\">0545b03</span><p class=\"lg\">馳趣於女色，<caesura/>猶猪樂糞穢。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b04\">0545b04</span><p class=\"lg\">愚者不能觀，<caesura/>欲染之過患，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b05\">0545b05</span><p class=\"lg\">妄生殷重想，<caesura/>猶若盲冥人。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b06\">0545b06</span><p class=\"lg\">為色所繫縛，<caesura/>增長於欲愛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b07\">0545b07</span><p class=\"lg\">猶如於野干，<caesura/>不離屍塚間。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b08\">0545b08</span><p class=\"lg\">於聲香味觸，<caesura/>而生愛著心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b09\">0545b09</span><p class=\"lg\">輪轉生死中，<caesura/>如獼猴繫柱。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b10\">0545b10</span><p class=\"lg\">無明纏覆故，<caesura/>為女所迷亂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b11\">0545b11</span><p class=\"lg\">如市求利人，<caesura/>矯詐來親附。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b12\">0545b12</span><p class=\"lg\">愚人親近欲，<caesura/>是入魔境界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b13\">0545b13</span><p class=\"lg\">猶若翳<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545005\">茶＝荼【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545005\">茶【大】，荼【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0545005\"><p class=\"lg\">茶</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">荼</rdg></app>迦，<caesura/>耽嗜於糞穢。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b14\">0545b14</span><p class=\"lg\">亦如霔雹雨，<caesura/>能損於稼穡，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b15\">0545b15</span><p class=\"lg\">窯師常近火，<caesura/>多為所焚燒。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b16\">0545b16</span><p class=\"lg\">諸未見諦者，<caesura/>為欲失白法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b17\">0545b17</span><p class=\"lg\">如風吹微糠，<caesura/>其義亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b18\">0545b18</span><p class=\"lg\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545006\">假＝後【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545006\">假【大】，後【宮】</span><app n=\"0545006\"><p class=\"lg\">假</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">後</rdg></app>如善丈夫，<caesura/>為殺者所執，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b19\">0545b19</span><p class=\"lg\">寧受斯逼害，<caesura/>不應親女人。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b20\">0545b20</span><p class=\"lg\">若樂觀女色，<caesura/>貪求轉復多，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b21\">0545b21</span><p class=\"lg\">取相之凡夫，<caesura/>增長於欲愛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b22\">0545b22</span><p class=\"lg\">如於炎夏時，<caesura/>遊行曠野中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b23\">0545b23</span><p class=\"lg\">渴逼飲鹹水，<caesura/>飲已渴彌增。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b24\">0545b24</span><p class=\"lg\">未見真實者，<caesura/>愚癡徒自<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545007\">活＝沃【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545007\">活【大】，沃【宮】</span><app n=\"0545007\"><p class=\"lg\">活</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">沃</rdg></app>，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b25\">0545b25</span><p class=\"lg\">親近於女人，<caesura/>貪欲愛堅固。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b26\">0545b26</span><p class=\"lg\">若人觸毒蟲，<caesura/>便為毒所害，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b27\">0545b27</span><p class=\"lg\">如是諸凡夫，<caesura/>犯欲亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b28\">0545b28</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如綵畫瓶，<caesura/>內盛以惡毒，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545b29\">0545b29</span><p class=\"lg\">是中實可畏，<caesura/>外相現端嚴。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c01\">0545c01</span><p class=\"lg\">嚴飾於女人，<caesura/>謂彼為姝妙，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c02\">0545c02</span><p class=\"lg\">是中甚穢惡，<caesura/>如氣滿皮囊。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c03\">0545c03</span><p class=\"lg\">又如以繒綵，<caesura/>纏<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545008\">裏＝裹【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545008\">裹【CB】【麗-CB】【宮】，裏【大】</span><app n=\"0545008\"><p class=\"lg\">裹<note type=\"cf1\">K06n0022_p0757a12</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">裏</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">裹</rdg></app>於利刀，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c04\">0545c04</span><p class=\"lg\">莊嚴彼女人，<caesura/>其義亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c05\">0545c05</span><p class=\"lg\">如火滿深坑，<caesura/>無烟能燒害，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c06\">0545c06</span><p class=\"lg\">女人亦如是，<caesura/>暴惡無哀愍。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c07\">0545c07</span><p class=\"lg\">如死狗死蛇，<caesura/>穢惡而壞爛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c08\">0545c08</span><p class=\"lg\">亦如燒糞穢，<caesura/>人皆厭惡之。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c09\">0545c09</span><p class=\"lg\">死蛇糞狗等，<caesura/>雖甚可厭惡，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c10\">0545c10</span><p class=\"lg\">如是諸女人，<caesura/>可厭復過彼。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c11\">0545c11</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如劫壞時，<caesura/>大地皆火起，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c12\">0545c12</span><p class=\"lg\">叢林諸草木，<caesura/>一切悉燋然。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c13\">0545c13</span><p class=\"lg\">大身者所居，<caesura/>海水盡乾竭，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c14\">0545c14</span><p class=\"lg\">須彌等寶山，<caesura/>世界遍燒壞。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c15\">0545c15</span><p class=\"lg\">如是劫燒時，<caesura/>焚燎於山海，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c16\">0545c16</span><p class=\"lg\">無有諸眾生，<caesura/>能為救護者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c17\">0545c17</span><p class=\"lg\">因茲女欲故，<caesura/>燒害諸愚夫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c18\">0545c18</span><p class=\"lg\">猶如劫火然，<caesura/>一切皆燒盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c19\">0545c19</span><p class=\"lg\">不淨常流注，<caesura/>涎<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0543011\"><p class=\"lg\">洟</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">涕</rdg></app>膿血身，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c20\">0545c20</span><p class=\"lg\">奈何彼愚夫，<caesura/>於此而耽著。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c21\">0545c21</span><p class=\"lg\">骸骨相<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545009\">搘＝枝【宋】，搘柱＝枝拄【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545009\">搘柱【大】，枝拄【宮】，枝柱【宋】</span><app n=\"0545009\"><p class=\"lg\">搘柱</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">枝拄</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】\">枝柱</rdg></app>，<caesura/>皮肉以覆之，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c22\">0545c22</span><p class=\"lg\">臭穢甚可惡，<caesura/>如棄殘宿食，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c23\">0545c23</span><p class=\"lg\">亦如倉廩門，<caesura/>糠<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545010\"><g ref=\"#CB00595\"/>＝<g ref=\"#CB01081\"/>【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545010\"><g ref=\"#CB00595\"/>【大】，<g ref=\"#CB01081\"/>【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0545010\"><p class=\"lg\"><g ref=\"#CB00595\"/></lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\"><g ref=\"#CB01081\"/></rdg></app>恒狼籍。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c24\">0545c24</span><p class=\"lg\">此身諸穢惡，<caesura/>充滿亦復然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c25\">0545c25</span><p class=\"lg\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545011\">胃＝胃【三】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0545011\">胃【大】，胃【宋】【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0545011\"><p class=\"lg\">胃</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">胃</rdg></app>脾腎肝膽，<caesura/>及腸肺糞穢，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c26\">0545c26</span><p class=\"lg\">并髓腦膿血，<caesura/>八萬戶諸虫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c27\">0545c27</span><p class=\"lg\">在中常唼食。<caesura/>盲冥諸愚夫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c28\">0545c28</span><p class=\"lg\">癡網自纏覆，<caesura/>於是不能了。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0545c29\">0545c29</span><p class=\"lg\">雜食所餘穢，<caesura/>九孔常流注，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a01\">0546a01</span><p class=\"lg\">如是過患身，<caesura/>由先不淨業。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a02\">0546a02</span><p class=\"lg\">愚夫於女人，<caesura/>繫戀彼聲色，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a03\">0546a03</span><p class=\"lg\">由斯生染著，<caesura/>曾不如實知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a04\">0546a04</span><p class=\"lg\">如蠅見於吐，<caesura/>而生愛著心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a05\">0546a05</span><p class=\"lg\">愚夫貪女人，<caesura/>境界亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a06\">0546a06</span><p class=\"lg\">顛仆於女色，<caesura/>恒自穢其身，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a07\">0546a07</span><p class=\"lg\">如何彼愚夫，<caesura/>於此樂遊止？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a08\">0546a08</span><p class=\"lg\">如鳥為求食，<caesura/>不知避網羅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a09\">0546a09</span><p class=\"lg\">貪愛於女人，<caesura/>被害亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a10\">0546a10</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如水中魚，<caesura/>游泳網者前，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a11\">0546a11</span><p class=\"lg\">便為他所執，<caesura/>豈非自損傷？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a12\">0546a12</span><p class=\"lg\">女若捕魚人，<caesura/>諂誑猶如網，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a13\">0546a13</span><p class=\"lg\">男子同於魚，<caesura/>被網亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a14\">0546a14</span><p class=\"lg\">殺者之利刀，<caesura/>雖復甚可畏，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a15\">0546a15</span><p class=\"lg\">女人刀可畏，<caesura/>傷害復過彼。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a16\">0546a16</span><p class=\"lg\">如蛾投燈炬，<caesura/>及火燒屋時，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a17\">0546a17</span><p class=\"lg\">蟲等被焚燒，<caesura/>無依無救者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a18\">0546a18</span><p class=\"lg\">迷醉於女人，<caesura/>貪火所燒害，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a19\">0546a19</span><p class=\"lg\">由斯墮惡趣，<caesura/>無依怙亦然。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a20\">0546a20</span><p class=\"lg\">邪行諸愚夫，<caesura/>愛戀他妻室，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a21\">0546a21</span><p class=\"lg\">妄生欣悅想，<caesura/>猶<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0546001\">如＝若【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0546001\">如【大】，若【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0546001\"><p class=\"lg\">如</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">若</rdg></app>於家鷄。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a22\">0546a22</span><p class=\"lg\">亦如曠野雉，<caesura/>妄遊殺害所，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a23\">0546a23</span><p class=\"lg\">損傷因自生，<caesura/>而無救濟者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a24\">0546a24</span><p class=\"lg\">捨離於佛法，<caesura/>親近彼女人，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a25\">0546a25</span><p class=\"lg\">由是業因緣，<caesura/>墜墮於惡道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a26\">0546a26</span><p class=\"lg\">又如諸獼猴，<caesura/>跳躑<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0546a2601\">巖【CB】，嚴【大】</span><app n=\"0546a2601\"><p class=\"lg\">巖</lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">嚴</rdg></app>樹間，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a27\">0546a27</span><p class=\"lg\">必致自損傷，<caesura/>豈不由愚惑？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a28\">0546a28</span><p class=\"lg\">如是耽欲者，<caesura/>於彼諸女人，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546a29\">0546a29</span><p class=\"lg\">為癡網所羅，<caesura/>數受生死苦。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b01\">0546b01</span><p class=\"lg\">如世之罪人，<caesura/>處以尖摽苦，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b02\">0546b02</span><p class=\"lg\">耽醉婬欲者，<caesura/>當懸劍樹林。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b03\">0546b03</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如以猛火，<caesura/>燒然彼鑊湯，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b04\">0546b04</span><p class=\"lg\">投之以麻麥，<caesura/>隨沸而漂沒。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b05\">0546b05</span><p class=\"lg\">如是耽欲人，<caesura/>不識於善<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0546002\">路＝惡【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0546002\">路【大】，惡【明】</span><app n=\"0546002\"><p class=\"lg\">路</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">惡</rdg></app>，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b06\">0546b06</span><p class=\"lg\">死當墮惡道，<caesura/>煎煮鑊湯中。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b07\">0546b07</span><p class=\"lg\">鑊湯之大數，<caesura/>六十四俱胝，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b08\">0546b08</span><p class=\"lg\">諸造惡之人，<caesura/>以彼為居處。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b09\">0546b09</span><p class=\"lg\">如是一一鑊，<caesura/>量各一由旬，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b10\">0546b10</span><p class=\"lg\">猛火遍燒然，<caesura/>底及四周際。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b11\">0546b11</span><p class=\"lg\">或有滿百年，<caesura/>或二三四百，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b12\">0546b12</span><p class=\"lg\">受煎煮之苦，<caesura/>皆由自業為。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b13\">0546b13</span><p class=\"lg\">獄卒以利鈎，<caesura/>時復舉令出，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b14\">0546b14</span><p class=\"lg\">皮肉皆爛墮，<caesura/>其骨白如珂。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b15\">0546b15</span><p class=\"lg\">於是諸獄卒，<caesura/>復將置鐵槽，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b16\">0546b16</span><p class=\"lg\">以杵而搗之，<caesura/>無能救護者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b17\">0546b17</span><p class=\"lg\">爾時諸骨髓，<caesura/>盡碎末為塵，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b18\">0546b18</span><p class=\"lg\">由業風所吹，<caesura/>死已復還活。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b19\">0546b19</span><p class=\"lg\">若有侵逼他，<caesura/>妻妾童女等，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b20\">0546b20</span><p class=\"lg\">當緣鐵刺樹，<caesura/>并受斧杵殃。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b21\">0546b21</span><p class=\"lg\">有三股鐵叉，<caesura/>或四五岐者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b22\">0546b22</span><p class=\"lg\">侵擾他妻室，<caesura/>當受此刑治。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b23\">0546b23</span><p class=\"lg\">復有鐵嘴烏，<caesura/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0546003\">深＝探【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0546003\">深【大】，探【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0546003\"><p class=\"lg\">深</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">探</rdg></app>啄於髓腦，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b24\">0546b24</span><p class=\"lg\">野干等諸獸，<caesura/>競來食噉之。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b25\">0546b25</span><p class=\"lg\">如是邪欲人，<caesura/>當墮<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0546004\">屍＝屎【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0546004\">屍【大】，屎【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0546004\"><p class=\"lg\">屍</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">屎</rdg></app>糞獄，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b26\">0546b26</span><p class=\"lg\">及走於鋒刃，<caesura/>亦復上刀山。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b27\">0546b27</span><p class=\"lg\">如是邪欲人，<caesura/>顛墜炎熱獄，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b28\">0546b28</span><p class=\"lg\">既被燒害已，<caesura/>復趣於寒氷。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546b29\">0546b29</span><p class=\"lg\">如是邪欲人，<caesura/>亦墮極炎熱，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c01\">0546c01</span><p class=\"lg\"><app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0545001\"><p class=\"lg\"><g ref=\"#CB00079\"/></lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">嘷</rdg></app>叫及大叫，<caesura/>并往黑繩中。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c02\">0546c02</span><p class=\"lg\">如是邪欲人，<caesura/>當沒鹹熱河，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c03\">0546c03</span><p class=\"lg\">復經歷煻煨，<caesura/>未至底便死。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c04\">0546c04</span><p class=\"lg\">地獄有蒺<g ref=\"#CB01420\"/>，<caesura/>五角極銛利，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c05\">0546c05</span><p class=\"lg\">彼為狗所逼，<caesura/>忙怖走其中。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c06\">0546c06</span><p class=\"lg\">愛戀於女人，<caesura/>墮於大怖處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c07\">0546c07</span><p class=\"lg\">或吞於鐵丸，<caesura/>或飲洋銅汁。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c08\">0546c08</span><p class=\"lg\">有二熱鐵山，<caesura/>彼此來相合，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c09\">0546c09</span><p class=\"lg\">昔時耽欲者，<caesura/>於中受苦殃。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c10\">0546c10</span><p class=\"lg\">受斯苦楚時，<caesura/>都無救護者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c11\">0546c11</span><p class=\"lg\">得如是罪報，<caesura/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0546005\">皆＝甘【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0546005\">皆【大】，甘【宮】</span><app n=\"0546005\"><p class=\"lg\">皆</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">甘</rdg></app>由自業緣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c12\">0546c12</span><p class=\"lg\">昔同歡愛者，<caesura/>今於何所在？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c13\">0546c13</span><p class=\"lg\">我獨受其殃，<caesura/>而不來相救。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c14\">0546c14</span><p class=\"lg\">由於先世中，<caesura/>自作如是業，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c15\">0546c15</span><p class=\"lg\">假令父母等，<caesura/>無能相救者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c16\">0546c16</span><p class=\"lg\">由於先世中，<caesura/>自作如是業，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c17\">0546c17</span><p class=\"lg\">假令男女等，<caesura/>無能相救者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c18\">0546c18</span><p class=\"lg\">由於先世中，<caesura/>自作如是業，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c19\">0546c19</span><p class=\"lg\">假令兄弟等，<caesura/>無能相救者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c20\">0546c20</span><p class=\"lg\">由於先世中，<caesura/>自作如是業，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c21\">0546c21</span><p class=\"lg\">假令姊妹等，<caesura/>無能相救者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c22\">0546c22</span><p class=\"lg\">由於先世中，<caesura/>自作如是業，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c23\">0546c23</span><p class=\"lg\">假令朋友等，<caesura/>無能相救者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c24\">0546c24</span><p class=\"lg\">愚夫為邪欲，<caesura/>貪求於女人，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c25\">0546c25</span><p class=\"lg\">無間地獄中，<caesura/>受如是諸苦。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c26\">0546c26</span><p class=\"lg\">說此不清淨，<caesura/>穢惡之女人，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c27\">0546c27</span><p class=\"lg\">愚夫所遊行，<caesura/>智者皆遠離。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c28\">0546c28</span><p class=\"lg\">親近彼女人，<caesura/>最為極下劣，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0546c29\">0546c29</span><p class=\"lg\">是惡中之惡，<caesura/>何足為欣樂？</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a01\">0547a01</span><p class=\"lg\">耽<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0547001\">著＝欲【三】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0547001\">著【大】，欲【宋】【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0547001\"><p class=\"lg\">著</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">欲</rdg></app>諸凡夫，<caesura/>常抱於糞囊，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a02\">0547a02</span><p class=\"lg\">由此業因緣，<caesura/>當受無量苦。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a03\">0547a03</span><p class=\"lg\">愚夫為女人，<caesura/>受種種刑罰，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a04\">0547a04</span><p class=\"lg\">囚繫及捶打，<caesura/>而無厭離心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a05\">0547a05</span><p class=\"lg\">愚夫為女人，<caesura/>被種種燒害，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a06\">0547a06</span><p class=\"lg\">能忍受斯苦，<caesura/>而無厭離心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a07\">0547a07</span><p class=\"lg\">或置在尖標，<caesura/>或殺或沈水，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a08\">0547a08</span><p class=\"lg\">或擲於大坑，<caesura/>備受諸苦毒。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a09\">0547a09</span><p class=\"lg\">雖見如是苦，<caesura/>猶於婬欲中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a10\">0547a10</span><p class=\"lg\">稱讚於女人，<caesura/>曾不生厭離。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a11\">0547a11</span><p class=\"lg\">或有少智人，<caesura/>知為眾苦本，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a12\">0547a12</span><p class=\"lg\">見已還親近，<caesura/>如胡膠見火。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a13\">0547a13</span><p class=\"lg\">聞佛之所說，<caesura/>雖復生信受，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a14\">0547a14</span><p class=\"lg\">仍多畜女人，<caesura/>其眾如群羊。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a15\">0547a15</span><p class=\"lg\">或聞諸佛教，<caesura/>纔興厭悔心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a16\">0547a16</span><p class=\"lg\">須臾貪復生，<caesura/>如惡毒還發。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a17\">0547a17</span><p class=\"lg\">猶如被怖猪，<caesura/>暫止須臾頃，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a18\">0547a18</span><p class=\"lg\">若見於糞穢，<caesura/>貪愛還復生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a19\">0547a19</span><p class=\"lg\">愚夫聞法已，<caesura/>暫爾心驚怖，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a20\">0547a20</span><p class=\"lg\">後見諸欲色，<caesura/>貪愛還復生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a21\">0547a21</span><p class=\"lg\">猶如有丈夫，<caesura/>從其自身首，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a22\">0547a22</span><p class=\"lg\">棄擲金花鬘，<caesura/>翻戴於熱鐵。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a23\">0547a23</span><p class=\"lg\">愚夫耽欲故，<caesura/>棄捨諸佛教，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a24\">0547a24</span><p class=\"lg\">貪求下劣法，<caesura/>造作諸罪業。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a25\">0547a25</span><p class=\"lg\">迷醉諸欲者，<caesura/>墮閻羅界中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a26\">0547a26</span><p class=\"lg\">常吞熱鐵丸，<caesura/>復飲洋銅汁。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a27\">0547a27</span><p class=\"lg\">迷醉於欲者，<caesura/>背善而行非，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a28\">0547a28</span><p class=\"lg\">捨離於清<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0547002\">淨＝涼【三】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0547002\">淨【大】，涼【宋】【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0547002\"><p class=\"lg\">淨</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">涼</rdg></app>，<caesura/>永趣閻羅界。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547a29\">0547a29</span><p class=\"lg\">若有智慧人，<caesura/>聞我說是法，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547b01\">0547b01</span><p class=\"lg\">應捨一切欲，<caesura/>速求於出離。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547b02\">0547b02</span><p>爾時世尊說是偈已，優陀延王即白佛言：「今\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547b03\">0547b03</span>此所聞希有希有。如來、應、正等覺善能說是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547b04\">0547b04</span>諸欲過患。我今歸依佛法僧寶，從今已往乃\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547b05\">0547b05</span>至盡形歸佛法僧，作優婆塞。<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0547003\">唯＝惟【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0547003\">唯【大】，惟【明】</span><app n=\"0547003\"><p class=\"lg\">唯</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">惟</rdg></app>願世尊攝\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547b06\">0547b06</span>受於我。」</p><p>佛說此經已，優陀延王及諸大眾，天\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547b07\">0547b07</span>人世間阿修羅、乾闥婆等，聞佛所說，歡喜奉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547b08\">0547b08</span>行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0547b09\">0547b09</span><cb:juan n=\"097\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷第九十七</cb:jhead></cb:juan></cb:div>\r\n</body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}